Date: Sun, 7 Jun 2026 22:26:48 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 00882/11362] [outer-loop] Handoff: add TRUNCATION GUARD
 discipline (silent corruptor; applies to all gen evals)

Operator directive: token truncation silently scores would-be-correct solutions as wrong.
Every generation-based eval MUST report truncation_rate + no_answer_rate; >5% = INVALID,
raise the cap and re-run. PROVEN: MiniCPM base 0.30@256 -> 0.633@512 (66% of GSM8K
solutions > 256 tokens). Applies to ANY generation eval, not just this experiment.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
